---
import NovaShell from '../layouts/NovaShell.astro';
---
<NovaShell title="工程工具箱" description="单位换算、JSON 格式化和文本整理，均在浏览器本地完成。" active="/tools">
  <div class="page">
    <header class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">ENGINEERING TOOLBOX / 工程工具箱</p><h1>让细节<br /><em>有据可循。</em></h1><p class="lead">三个轻量工具，帮助处理工程工作中的常见小事。输入仅在当前浏览器处理，不会通过工具上传。</p></header>
    <nav class="tool-nav" aria-label="工具目录"><a href="#units">单位换算</a><a href="#json">JSON 校验</a><a href="#text">文本整理</a></nav>
    <section id="units" class="tool" aria-labelledby="units-title">
      <div class="heading"><span class="number">01</span><div><h2 id="units-title">单位换算</h2><p>选择类别与单位，输入数值后自动换算；可选择结果的有效数字位数。</p></div></div>
      <div class="unit-grid">
        <label for="unit-kind">类别<select id="unit-kind"><option value="length">长度</option><option value="mass">质量</option><option value="temperature">温度</option><option value="power">功率</option></select></label>
        <label for="unit-value">输入数值<input id="unit-value" type="text" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" placeholder="例如 25.4" aria-invalid="false" aria-describedby="unit-status unit-note" /></label>
        <label for="unit-from">原单位<select id="unit-from"></select></label>
        <label for="unit-to">目标单位<select id="unit-to"></select></label>
        <label for="unit-precision">有效数字<select id="unit-precision"><option value="4">4 位</option><option value="6">6 位</option><option value="8">8 位</option><option value="12" selected>12 位</option><option value="15">15 位</option></select></label>
      </div>
      <p id="unit-note" class="note">输入和结果绝对值均不得超过 1×10¹⁵。温度只适用于绝对温度，不适用于温差；hp 为机械马力。结果供工程前期参考，不替代安全验算。</p>
      <div class="result" aria-live="polite"><span id="unit-status">等待输入</span><output id="unit-result">—</output></div><div class="actions"><button type="button" id="unit-example">填入示例</button><button type="button" id="unit-copy">复制结果</button><span id="unit-copy-status" role="status"></span></div>
    </section>
    <section id="json" class="tool" aria-labelledby="json-title">
      <div class="heading"><span class="number">02</span><div><h2 id="json-title">JSON 校验与格式化</h2><p>粘贴 JSON（JavaScript 对象表示法），先校验，再选择缩进格式化或压缩。</p></div></div>
      <label for="json-input">输入 JSON<textarea id="json-input" rows="8" spellcheck="false" aria-invalid="false" aria-describedby="json-status" placeholder="在此粘贴 JSON"></textarea></label>
      <div class="actions"><button type="button" id="json-example">填入示例</button><button type="button" id="json-check">校验</button><label for="json-indent" class="inline-label">缩进<select id="json-indent"><option value="2">2 个空格</option><option value="4">4 个空格</option></select></label><button type="button" id="json-format">格式化</button><button type="button" id="json-minify">压缩</button></div>
      <p class="note">输入上限为 1 MiB（1,048,576 字节）；输出由浏览器解析后重新生成，数字精度受 JavaScript 限制，请勿用于保留超大整数或原始格式。</p>
      <p id="json-status" class="status" role="status">等待输入</p><label for="json-output">输出结果<textarea id="json-output" rows="8" readonly></textarea></label><div class="actions"><button type="button" id="json-copy">复制结果</button><span id="json-copy-status" role="status"></span></div>
    </section>
    <section id="text" class="tool" aria-labelledby="text-title">
      <div class="heading"><span class="number">03</span><div><h2 id="text-title">文本去重与批量整理</h2><p>每行输入一项；点击整理以删除空行、保留首次出现的内容。</p></div></div>
      <label for="text-input">输入文本<textarea id="text-input" rows="8" spellcheck="false" placeholder="每行一项"></textarea></label>
      <div class="actions"><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" id="text-trim" checked />去除行首尾空白</label><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" id="text-sort" />按文字排序</label><button type="button" id="text-example">填入示例</button><button type="button" id="text-process">整理文本</button></div>
      <p class="note">去重区分大小写；未勾选去除首尾空白时，保留原始空格，但纯空白行仍会删除。</p><p id="text-status" class="status" role="status">等待输入</p><label for="text-output">输出结果<textarea id="text-output" rows="8" readonly></textarea></label><div class="actions"><button type="button" id="text-copy">复制结果</button><span id="text-copy-status" role="status"></span></div>
    </section>
  </div>
</NovaShell>
<script>import { mountTools } from '../scripts/tools/ui'; mountTools();</script>
<style>
.page{max-width:1120px;margin:auto;padding:clamp(48px,8vw,100px) clamp(20px,5vw,64px) 90px;color:#202923}.page *{box-sizing:border-box;min-width:0}.hero{max-width:700px}.eyebrow,.number{font:12px ui-monospace,monospace;letter-spacing:.14em;color:#52735e}h1,h2{font-family:"Songti SC","Noto Serif CJK SC",SimSun,serif;font-weight:600}h1{font-size:clamp(42px,6vw,76px);line-height:1.14;margin:20px 0}h1 em{font-style:normal;color:#52735e}.lead,.heading p{line-height:1.8;color:#4b5b50}.tool-nav{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin:34px 0 0}.tool-nav a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;padding:8px 16px;border:1px solid #b78b57;color:#3f604c;text-decoration:none}.tool{margin-top:36px;border-top:1px solid #b78b57;padding-top:28px;scroll-margin-top:24px}.heading{display:flex;gap:22px;align-items:baseline}.heading h2{font-size:clamp(26px,3vw,36px);margin:0}.heading p{margin:10px 0 22px}.unit-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px}label{display:grid;gap:8px;font-size:14px;color:#3f604c}input,select,textarea,button{font:inherit;color:#202923;border:1px solid #b78b57;border-radius:2px;background:#fbf9f3}input,select,button{min-height:44px}input,select,textarea{width:100%;padding:10px}textarea{display:block;resize:vertical;font:14px/1.6 ui-monospace,monospace;overflow-wrap:anywhere}button{cursor:pointer;padding:10px 16px;color:#3f604c}button:hover,.tool-nav a:hover{background:#e8ecdf}button:focus-visible,a:focus-visible,input:focus-visible,select:focus-visible,textarea:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #a74432;outline-offset:2px}[aria-invalid="true"]{border-color:#a74432}.note,.status{font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#526458;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.result{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;border-left:3px solid #a74432;background:#eeeade;padding:18px;margin:16px 0}.result output{font:600 20px ui-monospace,monospace;overflow-wrap:anywhere;user-select:all}.actions{display:flex;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin:14px 0}.actions span{font-size:13px;color:#3f604c}.inline-label{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}.inline-label select{width:auto}.check{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;min-height:44px}.check input{width:20px;height:20px;min-height:0;accent-color:#52735e}@media(max-width:850px){.unit-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}@media(max-width:480px){.unit-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.heading{gap:12px}.result{display:grid}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{scroll-behavior:auto}}
</style>
